// HEXAD/LIFE/state/h208_prime_density_2026_05_23/run_h208.hexa
// H_208 — prime-density-fluctuation · Riemann × consciousness math-axis
//         sister to H_157 (mathematical panpsychism). raw#12 strict.
//
//   Question: do prime-gap sequences (the algebraic structure tied to the
//   Riemann hypothesis) carry MORE integrated information Φ than
